        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 2 : Assign the first 222 tasks to the first worker, and the 333rd task to the second worker. Then, P=[1,1,2]P = [1, 1, 2]P=[1,1,2] is the array formed. This is non decreasing as required in the statement.\nThe worker 111 first works on the first task, starting at 111, finishing it by time 333. His skill deficiency factor was 222 hence he took 222 time units to complete the task. Then, he instantly moves on to the 222nd task, starting it immediately, and finishing it by time 999.\nThe worker 222 starts at time 333, and takes 999 units because his skill deficiency is 333 and the normal task time is 333. Thus, both workers finish their work by 121212 and this is optimal.\nTest Case 3 : All tasks are assigned to worker 111."
